  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **First number + (Second number × 2) = Third number.**\n\nGiven,\n\n(23, 6, 35)\n\n⇒ 23 + __**(6 × 2)**__\n\n__**23 + 12**__ = 35\n\n(13, 5, 23) \n\n⇒ 13 + __**(5 × 2)**__\n\n__**13 + 10**__ = 23\n\nNow, checking the options:\n\nOption 1) (24, 5, 33) \n\n⇒ 24 + __**(5 × 2)**__\n\n__**24 + 10**__\n\n34 ≠ 33.\n\nOption 2) (16, 4, 20)\n\n⇒ 16 + __**(4 × 2)**__\n\n__**16 + 8**__ \n\n24 ≠ 20.\n\n**Option 3) (25, 8, 41)**\n\n**⇒ 25 + __(8 × 2)__**\n\n**__25 + 16__ **\n\n**41 = 41.**\n\nOption 4) (13, 7, 28)\n\n⇒ 13 + __**(7 × 2)**__ \n\n__**13 + 14**__\n\n27 ≠ 28.\n\nHence, the correct option is \"Option 3\".",
